		{"id":"node-rf-theory-summary","type":"text","text":"## R & C Resonant Selection Theory\n\n* **Carrier Frequency**: 13.56 MHz (ISO 14443A)\n* **Trace Width ($w$) & Gap ($s$)**: $w = 0.25\\,\\text{mm}$, $s = 0.25\\,\\text{mm}$\n* **Coil Inductance ($L$)**: **1.262 µH** (7 turns, 17.5mm square)\n* **Tuning Capacitor ($C$)**: **100 pF** (50V C0G/NP0, nearest E12 standard)\n  * *Ideal Thomson*: $C_{\\text{ideal}} = \\frac{1}{\\omega_0^2 L} = 109.2\\,\\text{pF}$\n  * *Detuning Tolerance*: $Q=25$ gives $542\\,\\text{kHz}$ bandwidth. With $100\\,\\text{pF} + 5\\,\\text{pF}$ stray ($13.83\\,\\text{MHz}$), flux remains $>72\\%$. Tag loading reactively pulls resonance down into $13.56\\,\\text{MHz}$.\n* **Damping Resistor ($R$)**: **3.3 Ω** (1% 0603)\n  * *Target Q-Factor*: $Q = 25$ ($B = 542\\,\\text{kHz}$ for 848 kHz subcarrier)\n  * *Loop Equation*: $R_{\\text{total}} = \\frac{\\omega_0 L}{Q} \\approx 4.30\\,\\Omega$\n  * $R_{\\text{damp}} = 4.30 - 0.66_{\\text{coil}} - 0.35_{\\text{mux}} = 3.29\\,\\Omega \\to \\mathbf{3.3\\,\\Omega}$","x":6160,"y":865,"width":980,"height":940,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-lexicons","type":"file","file":"docs/Multi_Language_Lexicons.md","x":7067,"y":201,"width":870,"height":1900,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-loom-proto","type":"file","file":"docs/Prototype_4x4_Shopping_List.md","x":-4360,"y":1840,"width":900,"height":1280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-loom-full","type":"file","file":"docs/Production_15x15_Sourcing_List.md","x":-4380,"y":3200,"width":940,"height":1320,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-hw-3d-render","type":"file","file":"hardware/kicad/test_grid_4x4/test_grid_4x4_3d_iso.png","x":2540,"y":-40,"width":1007,"height":560,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-proto-wiring-table","type":"file","file":"docs/Prototype_4x4_Wiring_Pinout.md","x":2540,"y":2980,"width":1100,"height":2200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-bench-mux-verified","type":"text","text":"## 4x4 Bench MUX & Tag Verification: SUCCESS\n\n* **CD74HC4067 SMT IC**: Footprint SOIC-24W verified 100% correct.\n* **Power & Control**: 3.3V rail & S0-S3 channel switching verified.\n* **Physical Channel Switching**: Channel 0 conducts (0.24V divider through coil inductor).\n* **NTAG213 Tag Reading**: 7-byte UID physical tag detection verified.\n* **Silent Firmware**: Event-driven tag detection and removal; zero background spam.\n* **Living Memory**: FAIL-015 & ISO14443A energy harvesting invariant recorded in `wise.md`.\n* **Next Step**: Connect IPEX RF pigtail & test tag reads across 16 PCB matrix positions.","x":3840,"y":2980,"width":800,"height":550,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-hw-specs","type":"text","text":"## Key Hardware Numbers\n\n* **Frequency**: 13.56 MHz (NFC)\n* **Coil Inductance**: ~1.5 µH per coil\n* **Switches**: 74HC4067 multiplexers\n* **Wood Thickness**: Under 2.5mm\n* **Scan Speed**: Under 500ms for all 225 tiles\n* **Battery**: 3.7V 3000mAh + magnetic plug\n* **Turntable**: 250mm ball-bearing ring","x":680,"y":-100,"width":420,"height":380,"color":"5"},
