		{"id":"node-cad-assembly-notes","type":"text","text":"## 4x4 Master 3D Assembly\n\n* **Base Tray**: Houses PCB with 3.5mm standoffs\n* **PCB Mockup**: 100x100mm 4-layer NFC board\n* **Top Grid Plate**: 1.5mm RF floor + 1.2mm ribs\n* **Tiles**: 16 NFC Scrabble tiles with NTAG213\n* **Fasteners**: 4x M3 screws (90mm pitch)\n* **Openings**: J1 (Host), J2 (NFC), J3 (SMA)","x":9520,"y":1210,"width":1400,"height":450,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-cad-render-base","type":"file","file":"hardware/cad/output/base_enclosure_3d.png","x":11400,"y":-80,"width":1000,"height":750,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-android-companion","type":"text","text":"## Native Android Companion App\n\n* **Location**: `software/android/`\n* **Tech**: Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Material 3, Gradle 9.1\n* **Board**: Interactive 4x4 test grid with 2W/3W/2L/3L & rack\n* **Referee**: Tournament English referee (168k words)\n* **Auth**: 1-Tap play & Google Sign-In with Firebase\n* **Persistence**: Local-first SQLite (`AppDatabaseHelper`)\n* **Pairing**: Unique handles (`sarah#4821`, `board_scb1234`)\n* **Living Memory**: `software/android/android_lessons.md`","x":11820,"y":-5520,"width":1600,"height":700,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-android-readme","type":"file","file":"software/android/README.md","x":11820,"y":-4770,"width":1600,"height":900,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-android-lessons","type":"file","file":"software/android/android_lessons.md","x":11820,"y":-3760,"width":1600,"height":800,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-android-auth-db","type":"text","text":"## Google Auth & SQLite Database\n\n* **Firebase Project**: `smart-crossword-2177f`\n* **Google Auth**: Google Play Services + Firebase Auth\n* **Web Client ID**: `810714924778-...apps.googleusercontent.com`\n* **Debug SHA-1**: `93:5F:39:...:53`\n* **Database**: Local SQLite `crossword_companion.db`\n* **Inspector Tool**: `./software/android/inspect_db.sh`\n* **Clean/Reset**: `./inspect_db.sh --clear` or in-app reset button\n* **Tables**: `users`, `friends`, `games` with session exclusivity","x":13570,"y":-5520,"width":1600,"height":700,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-android-tests","type":"text","text":"## Automated Test Suites (JVM & Hardware)\n\n* **15 JVM Unit Tests** (`./gradlew testDebugUnitTest`):\n  * `FirebaseConfigTest`: SHA-1 hash & Web Client ID\n  * `RefereeTest`: 168k words, 2W/3W/2L/3L math, 26 letter values, vertical/horizontal words, gaps\n  * `MainScreenViewModelTest`: View model state\n* **6 On-Device Instrumented Tests** (`./gradlew connectedDebugAndroidTest`):\n  * `AppDatabaseDeviceTest`: Real hardware execution on OnePlus 7T Pro\n  * Tests: DB schema, board seed (`board_scb8492`), session exclusivity, logout, friends, reset\n* **All 21 automated tests passing**","x":13570,"y":-4770,"width":1600,"height":900,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-android-ble","type":"text","text":"## BLE GATT Protocol & Live Radar Scanner\n\n* **ESP32 BLE Server**: Advertises as `SmartCrossword_4x4`\n* **Service UUID**: `19B10000-E8F2-537E-4F6C-D104768A1214`\n* **Characteristics**:\n  * `19B10001`: Board State (16-byte Notify, 'A'..'Z' or '.')\n  * `19B10002`: Scan Telemetry (2-byte Notify: channel + status)\n  * `19B10003`: Command Ingest (Write: 0x01 Sweep, 0x02 Continuous, 0x10 Submit)\n* **Android Client**: `BleManager.kt` with state flows and permissions\n* **Live Visual Feedback**: Pulsating cyan/amber radar glow on active scanning square in `Board4x4Screen.kt`\n* **Tile Sync**: Instant physical tile drop-in & referee validation\n* **Verification**: Tested over-the-air with Python Bleak (`scripts/test_ble_link.py`) & JVM unit tests","x":13570,"y":-3760,"width":1600,"height":800,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"24bfabc34d756506","x":15397,"y":-4159,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":""},
		{"id":"node-pn532-single-test","type":"file","file":"firmware/pn532_single_test/README.md","x":9640,"y":-3840,"width":1050,"height":2620,"color":"4"}
